  "description": "Opt-in background DEK rotation for Vellum envelope encryption. A hosted service periodically rotates Data Encryption Keys whose active key is older than a configurable maximum age, with per-scope retry and exponential backoff inside each tick. A failed rotation always leaves the previous key active (fail-safe), and one scope failing never aborts the rotation of the others.",
